{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"分离态射"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"分离态射"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 称为<strong>分离</strong> (separated) 态射, 是指"},{"Local":{"url":"对角线","text":"对角线"}},{"Plain":" $X\\to X\\times_Y X$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"闭嵌入","text":"闭嵌入"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>概形 $X$ 称为分离概形是指 $X\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathbb{Z})$ 是分离态射.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"分离几何态射","text":"分离几何态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}